   "title": "Swollen joints: ASPIRATE · the synovial fluid sorts it",
   "lines": [
    "normal fluid: clear · transparent · viscosity high · WBC < 200 · PMN < 25%",
    "then blood tests for what the fluid and history point to: ESR, CRP · RF, anti-CCP · ANA → ENA, dsDNA, C3, C4"
   ]
  },
